    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must provide response times compatible with daily clinical use, achieve a high level of answer relevance, integrate with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and ensure data sovereignty." ;
