    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our project management methodologies, past public sector references, and consortium partners' expertise, how can our ensure the successful deployment of the proposed solution within the 5-year timeframe while maintaining the expected level of service? our can ensure the successful deployment of the proposed solution by leveraging our hybrid delivery model that combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. leveraging has been successfully applied in past public sector projects, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer projects.  our project management methodologies includes two-week sprints with demonstrable increments, which will allow our to progressively deploy the proposed solution while maintaining a high level of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The phase-gate structure, comprising Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run phases, will enable our to conduct a thorough pilot phase on a limited perimeter, followed by progressive generalisation to all services. our partnership with Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator, will facilitate the integration of the proposed solution with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), ensuring seamless interoperability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our joint research programme with a French public AI research laboratory on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability will enable our to provide a high-quality solution that meets the client's expectations. our will also ensure that the proposed solution is hosted on OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider that complies with SecNumCloud qualification and HDS certification, guaranteeing data sovereignty and security." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following this approach, our are confident that our can successfully deploy the proposed solution within the 5-year timeframe while maintaining the expected level of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

